  "goodToKnow": "Die Ortschaft is a village or locality, a small settlement: eine kleine Ortschaft im Schwarzwald. In traffic law, innerhalb geschlossener Ortschaften (within built-up areas) the speed limit is 50 km/h; the yellow place-name sign marks where it begins. Außerhalb geschlossener Ortschaften it's 100 km/h. Der Ort means place, village or town, and die Ortschaft is a slightly more formal word for a small Ort. Plural: die Ortschaften."
